  "duration_seconds": 87.66666666666667,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C01",
      "text": "第二天，我去物流园补资料，刚好走到办公室门口，听见马主任把一张通知拍在桌上。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "24f12b47df9456493163cf8ff4168a6f3eef859216f594dba6ac7b3018f0d7c1",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.0595625,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 182,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "4a040fa588c81d59b15b4f43fa86c611c0e801b253481db5fa39c7e539c85348",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "sample_count": 290859
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C02",
      "text": "他说，谁让你拦客户的货？你一个保安，查什么货？明天不用来了。夏凛只说，按规定巡查。马主任说，规定是我定的。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b4cd6fd3c82e0bcdbdd9617d29c01d822f432448b3e9fd18b31aed172d06c203",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.697520833333334,
      "start_frame": 185,
      "end_frame": 446,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "a398c7201bc3431e3a5ecc0a6c48f058429f65feaf6ee42cf6003c0828dc9759",
      "source_duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "sample_count": 417481
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C03",
      "text": "我在走廊等她出来。她怀里的纸箱，只装着一个水杯，一块夹板，和那本旧本子。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4ef8f8a7e8ca1492b3184f7c9e4993592a61b4a8e7b9ed9d5dd8d7f717fc5cfa",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.61775,
      "start_frame": 449,
      "end_frame": 618,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f4ade87d41d56e88ac089c51d08b0ec697bfe682df439109fd971737c14e94a8",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "sample_count": 269652
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C04",
      "text": "我递上名片，说，月薪五万，守一间屋，日结。她问，你精神没问题吧？\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "247ed928a493cb31302e22fe34908aa6ee3b0106ce643d0a51e84b441f962e76",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.768645833333333,
      "start_frame": 621,
      "end_frame": 795,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "434b86952c7d740412e5d1a26228ba7567d9f725e3c3e4c804e69e72f32c23c9",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "sample_count": 276895
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C05",
      "text": "我说，园区里都传，你每个月往战友家里汇钱。你一个月工资四千二，汇八千，靠什么？我一次付你三个月。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ddc7dd859ad215f215e2a3462402db0a3c68e1e9f8b2961846cfba040097db88",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.7490625,
      "start_frame": 798,
      "end_frame": 1031,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "bc69b4852ad8d38846b9afd37df6456a34a6bd83ff940de3001c45ed8619f9a2",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "sample_count": 371955
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C06",
      "text": "她眼神一冷，说，别查我。我说，不是查，是算账。她沉默了很久，说，先看屋。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "fd81100d67c522668239e3d8d5bc8851dbabe5637636d9c8d41c07af2246646e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.695895833333333,
      "start_frame": 1034,
      "end_frame": 1235,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3dd702b734fa6f574cf4b36943ed3f92636eeb93f09ad91317e509a3537d6933",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "sample_count": 321403
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C07",
      "text": "到了梧桐里，她绕着一楼转了一圈，说，窗口太低，易攻难守。我说，不是这间。我推开了卧室的门。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f073132b207f8e79dd86f2c50b5d2a9a43ccc327cb8610a1d02990201677ce41",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.0839375,
      "start_frame": 1238,
      "end_frame": 1481,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "42a3cbe44b48318340d8695380c82d430acec867da49dbdad5b3ca716034b6a4",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.5,
      "sample_count": 388029
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C08",
      "text": "她右手立刻按住短棍。她摸墙，用脚尖敲地，沿着货架走了一整圈。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "8a463d6f7df96a976e84c12a9b6c440ac2c147f8f87668c1c17996e8f3b0bdb5",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.085833333333333,
      "start_frame": 1484,
      "end_frame": 1637,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5837c1576674bc7a68b3c9db1afe193227de7b17ac89fd647680b9a111372a9e",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "sample_count": 244120
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C09",
      "text": "最后，她站在外墙本该在的位置，说，不是投影，是实体。两百平方米，从院子里根本找不到。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "65e2233ec7899a63fb1732fb210060039f8aad847a50edde100f3582a26ff17c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.3165625,
      "start_frame": 1640,
      "end_frame": 1860,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "de8947450792963dcc3595022d0c9bb6068a9659f3df632f2c0a97d836fa7852",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "sample_count": 351195
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C10",
      "text": "我把手机递给她。绑定页，倒计时，距离血月降临，八十三天。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "6b58fa3ae85742ba023f36eea230489ee2b7749b3686e9c02bd22705627f6c44",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.9296875,
      "start_frame": 1863,
      "end_frame": 2011,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "51df83a8c6572c03f33a34ff1b135b1573f98cc5510dabaa1d6cf0d3c35ec164",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "sample_count": 236625
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C11",
      "text": "她问，你疯了，还是我疯了？我说，你可以不信。但你见过的任何营地，有这里安全吗？\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "51af78d6a48d44583188d2efc04b015012beddea82c1f8485852bf1f6fd8d88e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.393041666666667,
      "start_frame": 2014,
      "end_frame": 2206,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "db447accc180f5882d91dfbe04aa3416277f247b3475a54361a2dfaf28aed34a",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "sample_count": 306866
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C12",
      "text": "我把三条屋规，放到合同旁边。不能伤害同住者，贡献记账，危机时听指挥。预付款转过去，到账提醒一响，她才落笔。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ba595821f4f1949405483dbed00808f97a4100c879938bc9327233b260f443d6",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.748895833333334,
      "start_frame": 2209,
      "end_frame": 2472,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "b645f04e27b72c089f825247e3d7df8a525e688c9a0dc174f07bd9b3072cc505",
      "source_duration_seconds": 11.4,
      "sample_count": 419947
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP006-C13",
      "text": "她抬头，看了一眼墙上的倒计时，问我，归零之后，我要守的是什么？\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/speed1p3/EP006-C13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0fbc3b38300c7a93b572958bafff825365ba797f72fc8dc6dea1c041593147cf",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.138729166666667,
      "start_frame": 2475,
      "end_frame": 2630,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP006/audio/EP006-C13.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "a18da064d6be630cd58792597d041acc1ee20fd299edd27a4e07012ccc0da61d",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "sample_count": 246659
    }
  ],
